{"id":"w-a-criswell","n":"W.A. Criswell","photo":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/images/headshots/bio_wa_criswell.jpg","bio":"W.A. Criswell was one of the most influential Southern Baptist pastors of the 20th century. Considered the father of modern conservatism in the SBC, he founded Criswell College and KCBI Radio. He preached biblical inerrancy at a time when many Baptist institutions were theologically moderate or liberal. During his 50-year tenure, First Baptist Dallas became the largest church in the Southern Baptist Convention. His and our favorite text is Isaiah 40:8.","queue":["8423","21866","6990","27438","27510","8960","12937","21853","6862","12227","6989","27509"],"talks":{"8423":{"t":"Bible and the Inner Life, the - Romans 7:22","sp":"w-a-criswell","tp":["Word of God, The","Purity"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/4162ABA.mp3","lk":3},"21866":{"t":"Heart to Care and a Spirit to Try, A","sp":"w-a-criswell","tp":[],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/DLS0428D.mp3","lk":2},"6990":{"t":"Holy Spirit and Tongues","sp":"w-a-criswell","tp":["Holy Spirit","Tongues"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/3167A.mp3","lk":18},"27438":{"t":"Imperishable Word of God","sp":"w-a-criswell","tp":["Inerrancy","Word of God, The"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/NET00016.mp3","lk":0},"27510":{"t":"Leading America Back to God","sp":"w-a-criswell","tp":["Culture","Society, Impact on"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/NET00861.mp3","lk":0},"8960":{"t":"Man and the woman","sp":"w-a-criswell","tp":["Family","Men"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/432A.mp3","lk":0},"12937":{"t":"Our Mandate from Heaven","sp":"w-a-criswell","tp":["Great Commission","Heaven"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/726A.mp3","lk":0},"21853":{"t":"Our Mandate From Heaven","sp":"w-a-criswell","tp":[],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/DLS0425A.mp3","lk":24},"6862":{"t":"Power for and Dedication to the Cr